-- title: Object storage certificate expiring
-- description: The certificate for the S3 endpoint expires in under 14 days. Customers will see TLS errors.
-- severity: Medium
-- host: s3-svc.{wildcard_domain}
-- region: all
-- minimum_days_left: 14
-- timeout: 10
-- pending_for: 900
-- resolve_after: 1800
-- runbook_url: https://github.com/frappe/cargo/blob/develop/beacon/runbooks/service-certificate.md
-- Beacon reads the certificate that nginx serves. Customers reach their buckets on this name.
